<p>
  Cream is an internal tool for sales teams. If you have access, permissions or configuration issues,
  try these steps before contacting support.
</p>

<section>
  <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Common issues</h2>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
    <li><strong class="text-ink">Can’t sign in:</strong> check your email and password, or use “Forgot password?” on the sign-in screen.</li>
    <li><strong class="text-ink">I don’t see my workspace:</strong> ask a team admin to resend your invitation.</li>
    <li><strong class="text-ink">Permissions or data:</strong> workspace admins manage members, fields and integrations under Settings.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section>
  <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Contact</h2>
  <p>
    For technical issues or questions about the service, email
    <%= mail_to cream_support_email, cream_support_email, class: "text-accent hover:underline" %>.
    Include your organization, sign-in email and a short description of the problem.
  </p>
  <p>
    Response hours: business days, 9:00–18:00 (Central European Time). For critical production issues, say so in the subject line.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Documentation</h2>
  <p>
    Workspace admins can configure integrations (Gmail, Stripe, Slack, webhooks and automations) from Cream’s sidebar.
  </p>
</section>
